    "metadata": {
      "title": "CSA Cyber Trust mark – All preparedness tiers, AI security requirements (Annex B)",
      "last-modified": "2026-11-17T00:00:00+08:00",
      "version": "202504",
      "oscal-version": "1.1.2",
      "remarks": "Includes Supporter, Practitioner, Promoter, Performer and Advocate tier clauses. Derived from Annex B (printed pp. 30–111) of the CSA Cybersecurity Certification: Cyber Trust mark document (v202504), using the \"AI security\" column only. Only clauses with a AI-specific statement are included; clauses marked \"#\" in that column (meaning the Classical cybersecurity statement also applies) are omitted and are covered by the classical catalogs. Statements reproduce the source wording.",
      "links": [
        {
          "href": "#49b3f32a-0db7-581c-93ad-6fb3480ea2a3",
          "rel": "source"
        }
      ]
    },
    "groups": [
      {
        "id": "b.1",
        "class": "domain",
        "title": "Governance",
        "props": [
          {
            "name": "label",
            "value": "B.1"
          }
        ],
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "b.1.3",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Governance – B.1.3 (Promoter)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.1.3"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Promoter",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.1.3_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "Such practices include establishing mechanisms for: – The organisation to provide necessary security information about its AI systems to users and other relevant stakeholders, e.g. acceptable use policy of the AI systems in the organisation; and – Employees and external parties to report AI security concerns of the AI systems in the organisation."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b.1.4",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Governance – B.1.4 (Performer)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.1.4"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Performer",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.1.4_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "The organisation has defined and allocated roles and responsibilities for AI security due to the multidisciplinary nature of AI, which can cut across various organisational functions, e.g. functions overseeing ethics, legal matters, and risk areas."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b.1.5",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Governance – B.1.5 (Performer)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.1.5"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Performer",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.1.5_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "The Board and/or senior management should have sufficient expertise in AI security to make appropriate business decisions that take into consideration the implications associated with the specific risks of AI, e.g., over-reliance on AI."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b.1.6",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Governance – B.1.6 (Performer)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.1.6"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Performer",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.1.6_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "This includes identifying and documenting the objectives to guide the secure use of AI system(s) and ensuring these system(s) are used according to the intended purposes."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b.1.7",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Governance – B.1.7 (Advocate)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.1.7"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Advocate",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.1.7_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "The cybersecurity committee/forum has implemented measures to stay updated on fast-evolving AI security practices and governance landscapes, e.g., participating in AI special interest groups."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "b.2",
        "class": "domain",
        "title": "Policies and procedures",
        "props": [
          {
            "name": "label",
            "value": "B.2"
          }
        ],
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "b.2.3",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Policies and procedures – B.2.3 (Promoter)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.2.3"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Promoter",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.2.3_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "The organisation has implemented cross-functional or cross-team communications in areas where AI security intersects with other functional areas in the organisation, due to the multidisciplinary nature of AI."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b.2.4",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Policies and procedures – B.2.4 (Performer)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.2.4"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Performer",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.2.4_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "The organisation has established and implemented policies and procedures for the secure use of its AI system(s) in the organisation and integrated these policies and procedures with other organisational policies and procedures, e.g., enterprise and/or cybersecurity risk management."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b.2.8",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Policies and procedures – B.2.8 (Advocate)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.2.8"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Advocate",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.2.8_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "This includes policies and processes to ensure the secure use of AI system(s) and in accordance to organisational policies, including defining and documenting the processes for the secure use of AI system(s)."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "b.3",
        "class": "domain",
        "title": "Risk management",
        "props": [
          {
            "name": "label",
            "value": "B.3"
          }
        ],
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "b.3.1",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Risk management – B.3.1 (Supporter)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.3.1"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Supporter",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.3.1_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "The organisation has included AI-specific risks, including: – risk of data leakage arising from both malicious attacks and unintended data disclosure by employees; and – risk of compromise to the integrity of data and/or the AI model, resulting in unintended output from its AI system(s) and has included mechanisms to provide adequate human oversight over the organisation’s AI system(s)."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b.3.5",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Risk management – B.3.5 (Promoter)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.3.5"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Promoter",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.3.5_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "The organisation’s cybersecurity risk assessment for its AI systems has factored in and documented the resources utilised, e.g.: – data assets; – software assets; – systems and computing resources; and – employee use of AI to fully understand the risks and impact."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b.3.9",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Risk management – B.3.9 (Performer)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.3.9"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Performer",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.3.9_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "Where there are major or significant AI security risks that may not be mitigated, e.g., AI concentration risks, AI over-reliance, the trade-offs and appropriate mitigation measures shall be reported to and approved by the Board and/or senior management."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "b.3.12",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Risk management – B.3.12 (Advocate)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.3.12"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Advocate",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
                "value": "AI security",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              }
            ],
            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.3.12_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "For the organisation implementing AI systems, its policies and processes to review deviations have included ways to monitor for data and model drift that may impact the ability of the model to meet intended outcomes, resulting in changes in AI risk exposure."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "b.4",
        "class": "domain",
        "title": "Cyber strategy",
        "props": [
          {
            "name": "label",
            "value": "B.4"
          }
        ],
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "b.4.5",
            "class": "clause",
            "title": "Cyber strategy – B.4.5 (Advocate)",
            "props": [
              {
                "name": "label",
                "value": "B.4.5"
              },
              {
                "name": "preparedness-tier",
                "value": "Advocate",
                "ns": "https://www.csa.gov.sg/cyber-trust"
              },
              {
                "name": "security-context",
