            "parts": [
              {
                "id": "b.14.3_smt",
                "name": "statement",
                "prose": "These security guidelines and requirements have been established and implemented across the life cycle of the organisation’s AI systems, i.e.: – design; – development; – deployment; and – operations and maintenance."
